{"4183130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"WE'RE ALL IN!","steam_appid":4183130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5115060,5285180],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the minigames with none of the board-om. WE’RE ALL IN! pits you against your friends in high-stakes bets on who will emerge victorious in a wide variety of minigames, including 1v1s, team modes, and free-for-alls.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BET<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many chips are you willing to lay down on your buddy’s reflexes? Are they infamously shit at rock-paper-scissors? WE’RE ALL IN! will shine truth on your friendships.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/d653c6c9a7b32fb093797788f0da2a72.poster.avif?t=1793304912\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/d653c6c9a7b32fb093797788f0da2a72.webm?t=1793304912\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/d653c6c9a7b32fb093797788f0da2a72.mp4?t=1793304912\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bean your friends in the face with javelins. Dodge lasers while pushing your rivals over. Bet on who can obby the fastest. All this and much, much more! Plus, lobbies are highly customizable – turn off the minigames you hate with a passion or settle your disputes via sniper rifle duels. You dream it, WE’RE ALL IN! probably has it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/c9bfb084541de620f466eb6025084ce4.poster.avif?t=1793304912\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/c9bfb084541de620f466eb6025084ce4.webm?t=1793304912\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/c9bfb084541de620f466eb6025084ce4.mp4?t=1793304912\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WIN<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chips get converted into stars at a gradually increasing cost. Whoever has the most stars at the end wins. Watch out: bonus stars are awarded based on performance and just plain luck. When you’re done winning, spend your stars on unlockable cosmetics to mog your friends with. WE'RE ALL IN! Are you?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 1-8 player “co-op”<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens and dozens of minigames to compete in<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1, free-for-all, and team modes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly customizable lobbies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can push your friends over whenever you want<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the minigames with none of the board-om. WE’RE ALL IN! pits you against your friends in high-stakes bets on who will emerge victorious in a wide variety of minigames, including 1v1s, team modes, and free-for-alls.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BET<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many chips are you willing to lay down on your buddy’s reflexes? Are they infamously shit at rock-paper-scissors? WE’RE ALL IN! will shine truth on your friendships.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/d653c6c9a7b32fb093797788f0da2a72.poster.avif?t=1793304912\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/d653c6c9a7b32fb093797788f0da2a72.webm?t=1793304912\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/d653c6c9a7b32fb093797788f0da2a72.mp4?t=1793304912\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bean your friends in the face with javelins. Dodge lasers while pushing your rivals over. Bet on who can obby the fastest. All this and much, much more! Plus, lobbies are highly customizable – turn off the minigames you hate with a passion or settle your disputes via sniper rifle duels. You dream it, WE’RE ALL IN! probably has it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/c9bfb084541de620f466eb6025084ce4.poster.avif?t=1793304912\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/c9bfb084541de620f466eb6025084ce4.webm?t=1793304912\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/extras\/c9bfb084541de620f466eb6025084ce4.mp4?t=1793304912\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WIN<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chips get converted into stars at a gradually increasing cost. Whoever has the most stars at the end wins. Watch out: bonus stars are awarded based on performance and just plain luck. When you’re done winning, spend your stars on unlockable cosmetics to mog your friends with. WE'RE ALL IN! Are you?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 1-8 player “co-op”<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens and dozens of minigames to compete in<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1, free-for-all, and team modes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly customizable lobbies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can push your friends over whenever you want<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Experience minigame chaos in WE’RE ALL IN!, an online party game for 1-8 players where you win by betting on your friends in a series of fast-paced games and challenges.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/0917f5c4a4c932dda6acc54eee0060b23cf3488b\/header.jpg?t=1793304912","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/469a3e6c9d6168991b25b9430efd7d95ae6479cd\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793304912","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183130\/469a3e6c9d6168991b25b9430efd7d95ae6479cd\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793304912","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2nd Generation Core i3, AMD A6, or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia 8800 GT, AMD 5670, Intel HD 3000<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra (or higher)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 (2012 or newer) \/ Apple<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD 4000, AMD Radeon HD 6000 series, or Nvidia GeForce 600 series<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"}}}}